tion and if the same situation or a  similar situation were to develop again  you don't think that it would be for a  civil servant to be find themselves in  that position so who who should um judge  on the prime minister's behavior it has  to be the cabinet  parliament and eventually the electorate  well let's see what happens good to talk  to you my lord thank you so much for  joining us much appreciated thank you
 

